{"login": "Ahmad-danaf", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "efda16b60b69e00997d84df8da6fa63542eafae8", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nAdded 'main.ipynb' - Jupyter Notebook with the Python code for the Shoe Store Manager app.\r\n\r\nAdded 'TheApp.zip' - Zip file containing the pre-packaged executable app for Windows, along with the required Excel files for the clothes store inventory.\r\n\r\nThe 'main.ipynb' notebook contains the code for the clothesStore Manager, a simple Python application that provides a GUI for managing stock numbers and locations in the store's inventory.\r\n\r\nThe 'TheApp.zip' file contains the necessary files to run the app, including the 'kids.xlsx', 'women.xlsx', and 'men.xlsx' Excel files, along with the' clothes_store_manager.exe' executable for Windows users.\r\n\r\nThis update includes the complete app and its dependencies, making it easier for users to run the Shoe Store Manager without the need for separate installations or file placements.\r\n\r\nThe app offers features like filtering inventory by stock number, deleting stock numbers while keeping locations intact, and updating stock numbers by location.\r\n\r\nFeel free to explore the 'main.ipynb' notebook and run 'clothes_store_manager.exe' to use the app.", "created_at": "2023-07-27T14:25:11Z", "repo": "Exel_tool_App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "106a7d40b3ac8aeaa1b18cea197099730bfa2be8", "message": "Create README.md\n\nCreate README", "created_at": "2023-07-26T19:24:38Z", "repo": "Exel_tool_App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c9f83916813e5b43f4a168c259857fc04b1f756b", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-07-26T19:17:25Z", "repo": "Exel_tool_App", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95e61bf79afe649f9d97f14fe85a4b4d85e111e6", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nfirst work on the app,trying to go with matplotlib.pyp